1
00:00:00,079 --> 00:00:02,379
Den perfekte gaven til gartneren i

2
00:00:02,379 --> 00:00:03,500
familien din.

3
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:05,771
Mannen min elsker hagen sin, og

4
00:00:05,771 --> 00:00:08,261
han har klaget over det samme i to

5
00:00:08,261 --> 00:00:09,380
somre nå.

6
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:11,679
Alger i regnvannstanken.

7
00:00:11,679 --> 00:00:13,739
Jeg ville gi ham noe han faktisk

8
00:00:13,739 --> 00:00:15,734
ville bruke, ikke bare en dings

9
00:00:15,734 --> 00:00:17,639
som ender opp i et skap.

10
00:00:17,639 --> 00:00:20,441
Så jeg bestilte et IBC-tanktrekk

11
00:00:20,441 --> 00:00:22,017
fra Beverbutikken.

12
00:00:22,017 --> 00:00:24,559
Han ble helt overrasket.

13
00:00:24,559 --> 00:00:26,221
En stund trodde han at jeg hadde

14
00:00:26,221 --> 00:00:27,936
glemt problemet han hadde snakket

15
00:00:27,936 --> 00:00:29,319
om hele sommeren.

16
00:00:29,319 --> 00:00:31,544
Nå er tanken beskyttet, vannet er

17
00:00:31,544 --> 00:00:33,702
klart, og han viser den frem til

18
00:00:33,702 --> 00:00:35,000
alle naboene.

19
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,056
Noen ganger er den beste gaven den

20
00:00:37,056 --> 00:00:39,113
som løser et problem noen allerede

21
00:00:39,113 --> 00:00:40,559
har hatt lenge.

22
00:00:40,559 --> 00:00:42,880
Gi bort et IBC-tanktrekk fra

23
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:44,439
Beverbutikken.

24
00:00:44,439 --> 00:00:47,999
Enkel gave, stor takknemlighet.
